Define "Reject|-s|-ed|-ing|-or" to `<DEF>[["MOB{|Key: ~<@Name@>Error~|}^KY{|Key: ~runtime::Error::new~, Inputs: ~&[<@Message|Text@>]&~|}", "MOB{|Key: ~<@Name@>Result~|}^KY{|Key: ~Err~, Inputs: ~&[<@Name@>Error]&~|}", "<@Return@>"]]<DEF>`.
