Define "Emptybinding" as `<DEF>OB{|Key: ~mut <@Name@>: Option<<@Type@>>~, Value: ~None~|}<DEF>`.
Define "Publishedvalue" as `<DEF>MO{|Key: ~<@Name@>~|}^KY{|Key: ~Some~, Inputs: ~&[<@Value@>]&~|}<DEF>`.
