Define "Programcontext" as `<DEF>[["MOB{|Key: ~<@Name@>Runtime~|}^KY{|Key: ~clone~, Receiver: ~<@Runtime@>~|}", "OB{|Key: ~<@Name@>~, Value: ~(<@Name@>Runtime, <@Program@>)~|}", "OB{|Key: ~<@Binding@>~, Value: ~&<@Name@>.1~|}"]]<DEF>`.
